                ],
                "selected_slice": "Does a material change in a UCITS fund investment objective, policy or restriction require prior SFC approval under this circular, taking account of product features, home requirements and the application transition?",
                "source_key": "assurance.4ab832cf6eb51393902df2bf",
                "units": [
                  {
                    "locator": "https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 2:185",
                    "normative": true,
                    "span": {
                      "end": 185,
                      "id": "s.d97b56331f41a.u0.2",
                      "page": 1,
                      "quote_sha256": "b05484326a5409e0f778c605bceb798122a1d7c8053dcb52c3cc6d0f058c98fc",
                      "raw_sha256": "dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf",
                      "source_id": "d97b56331f41a",
                      "start": 2,
                      "text_sha256": "dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"
                    },
                    "text": "The Securities and Futures Commission (SFC) regularly reviews its operational processes and guidance to ensure their efficiency without compromising investor interests and protection.",
                    "unit_id": "d97b56331f41a.u0.2"
                  },
                  {
                    "locator": "https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 190:519",
                    "normative": true,
                    "span": {
                      "end": 519,
                      "id": "s.d97b56331f41a.u1.190",
                      "page": 1,
                      "quote_sha256": "6b12d6c0f8954dda7bf744822668a508b908697f1527d6e3129afa66a0cb261a",
                      "raw_sha256": "dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf",
                      "source_id": "d97b56331f41a",
                      "start": 190,
                      "text_sha256": "dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"
                    },
                    "text": "The SFC has further streamlined measures for processing certain post-authorisation matters for UCITS funds1, following its review and engagement with market participants. These measures aim at facilitating UCITS funds in implementing changes that are subject to their home regulator\u2019s supervision, and will take immediate effect.",
                    "unit_id": "d97b56331f41a.u1.190"
                  },
                  {
                    "locator": "https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 523:567",
                    "normative": true,
                    "span": {
                      "end": 567,
                      "id": "s.d97b56331f41a.u2.523",
                      "page": 1,
                      "quote_sha256": "79cfc2bdc8cf73658858fbedda8fa1c8e02083ef03416c48e19a3b3cdd61bb44",
                      "raw_sha256": "dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf",
                      "source_id": "d97b56331f41a",
                      "start": 523,
                      "text_sha256": "dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"
                    },
                    "text": "Further streamlined measures for UCITS funds",
                    "unit_id": "d97b56331f41a.u2.523"
                  },
                  {
                    "locator": "https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 575:651",
                    "normative": true,
                    "span": {
                      "end": 651,
                      "id": "s.d97b56331f41a.u3.575",
                      "page": 1,
                      "quote_sha256": "f3ff17acfa0e7dd0d2d11148ac213328c1e1e5d1bbcddc5121c05968817548ef",
                      "raw_sha256": "dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf",
                      "source_id": "d97b56331f41a",
                      "start": 575,
                      "text_sha256": "dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"
                    },
                    "text": "The key streamlined measures cover the following post-authorisation matters:",
                    "unit_id": "d97b56331f41a.u3.575"
                  },
                  {
                    "locator": "https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 653:838",
                    "normative": true,
                    "span": {
                      "end": 838,
                      "id": "s.d97b56331f41a.u4.653",
                      "page": 1,
                      "quote_sha256": "16fe8181147b7a5bca6aa5706c45d63547269aa88ced05fd83979842675b5dc3",
                      "raw_sha256": "dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf",
                      "source_id": "d97b56331f41a",
                      "start": 653,
                      "text_sha256": "dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"
                    },
                    "text": "(i)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Change of key operators \u2013 Removing the SFC\u2019s requirement on prior approval for change of depository and investment delegates which are under the home regulator\u2019s supervision.",
                    "unit_id": "d97b56331f41a.u4.653"
                  },
                  {
                    "locator": "https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 840:1219",
                    "normative": true,
                    "span": {
                      "end": 1219,
                      "id": "s.d97b56331f41a.u5.840",
                      "page": 1,
                      "quote_sha256": "e924d6ef6b60fd1b62d6427a511ae2cc4855b916b71eabbd5fff4846bb3f04d0",
                      "raw_sha256": "dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf",
                      "source_id": "d97b56331f41a",
                      "start": 840,
                      "text_sha256": "dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"
                    },
                    "text": "(ii)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Material changes in investment objectives, policies and restrictions \u2013 Removing the SFC\u2019s requirement on prior approval for material changes in investment objectives, policies and restrictions which comply with the fund\u2019s home jurisdiction requirements, except for changes that involve novel or complex product features and/or which may have local policy implications.",
                    "unit_id": "d97b56331f41a.u5.840"
                  },
                  {
                    "locator": "https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 1221:1414",
                    "normative": true,
                    "span": {
                      "end": 1414,
                      "id": "s.d97b56331f41a.u6.1221",
                      "page": 1,
                      "quote_sha256": "b214c05d1c35bece70b08892e935bd96f29f348208aaecfb45fcf6e1e51b81ce",
                      "raw_sha256": "dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf",
                      "source_id": "d97b56331f41a",
                      "start": 1221,
                      "text_sha256": "dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"
                    },
                    "text": "(iii)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Post-authorisation notifications \u2013 To align the SFC\u2019s notification requirements with the fund\u2019s home jurisdiction requirements, including the notice periods and content requirements.",
                    "unit_id": "d97b56331f41a.u6.1221"
                  },
                  {
                    "locator": "https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 1419:1675",
                    "normative": true,
                    "span": {
                      "end": 1675,
                      "id": "s.d97b56331f41a.u7.1419",
                      "page": 1,
                      "quote_sha256": "e51f0fd2001923f9c2dd0dfd3935561f6d192a6e8d99e2a2a784b78e4681d636",
                      "raw_sha256": "dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf",
                      "source_id": "d97b56331f41a",
                      "start": 1419,
                      "text_sha256": "dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"
                    },
                    "text": "The SFC has updated and published on its website relevant FAQs2 , including a revamped FAQ on SFC Authorization of UCITS Funds to facilitate UCITS fund managers in navigating post-authorisation compliance matters, as well as related forms and checklists3 .",
                    "unit_id": "d97b56331f41a.u7.1419"
                  },
                  {
                    "locator": "https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 1677:1691",
                    "normative": true,
                    "span": {
                      "end": 1691,
                      "id": "s.d97b56331f41a.u8.1677",
                      "page": 1,
                      "quote_sha256": "1cff7713912f5d538506c1ba82db75b7caabcd0ee2dc4abee6bbd4db5878233e",
                      "raw_sha256": "dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf",
                      "source_id": "d97b56331f41a",
                      "start": 1677,
                      "text_sha256": "dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"
                    },
                    "text": "Implementation",
                    "unit_id": "d97b56331f41a.u8.1677"
                  },
                  {
                    "locator": "https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 1696:1804",
                    "normative": true,
                    "span": {
                      "end": 1804,
                      "id": "s.d97b56331f41a.u9.1696",
                      "page": 1,
                      "quote_sha256": "fb0182e8746a0ef9172990e70c357cda13b223fec0ed72f5a2baf0405ffe12a6",
                      "raw_sha256": "dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf",
                      "source_id": "d97b56331f41a",
                      "start": 1696,
                      "text_sha256": "dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"
                    },
                    "text": "The streamlined measures set out in the relevant FAQs will take effect on 28 November 2025 (Effective Date).",
                    "unit_id": "d97b56331f41a.u9.1696"
                  },
                  {
                    "locator": "https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 1809:2028",
                    "normative": true,
                    "span": {
                      "end": 2028,
                      "id": "s.d97b56331f41a.u10.1809",
                      "page": 1,
                      "quote_sha256": "dfed4e2d2316df8ad47163dbc3855ec26331c4b7b38a58bc75220b6651988774",
                      "raw_sha256": "dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf",
                      "source_id": "d97b56331f41a",
                      "start": 1809,
                      "text_sha256": "dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"
                    },
                    "text": "Existing applications received by the SFC before the Effective Date for which no approval or authorisation has been granted will be processed by the SFC in accordance with the existing approval or authorisation process.",
                    "unit_id": "d97b56331f41a.u10.1809"
                  },
                  {
                    "locator": "https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 2030:2064",
                    "normative": true,
                    "span": {
                      "end": 2064,
                      "id": "s.d97b56331f41a.u11.2030",
                      "page": 1,
                      "quote_sha256": "8755027d3624aabe4e0f13fe4c2caf4836b7c5d45a2a107f563e3b04e3243778",
                      "raw_sha256": "dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf",
                      "source_id": "d97b56331f41a",
                      "start": 2030,
                      "text_sha256": "dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"
                    },
                    "text": "Obligation of management companies",
                    "unit_id": "d97b56331f41a.u11.2030"
                  },
                  {
                    "locator": "https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 2069:2372",
                    "normative": true,
                    "span": {
                      "end": 2372,
                      "id": "s.d97b56331f41a.u12.2069",
                      "page": 1,
                      "quote_sha256": "00a3ef2d8ea613c31c4bc187ef29bc54f93ac2813ed02bb1752b4b88983c6c3a",
                      "raw_sha256": "dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf",
                      "source_id": "d97b56331f41a",
                      "start": 2069,
                      "text_sha256": "dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"
                    },
                    "text": "The SFC will continue to conduct post-vetting of scheme changes (including those not subject to the SFC\u2019s prior approval) and related revised documents filed with the SFC. It may make follow-up enquiries and/or take appropriate regulatory actions in case of non-compliance to ensure investor protection.",
                    "unit_id": "d97b56331f41a.u12.2069"
                  },
                  {
                    "locator": "https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 2377:2486",
                    "normative": true,
                    "span": {
                      "end": 2486,
                      "id": "s.d97b56331f41a.u13.2377",
                      "page": 1,
                      "quote_sha256": "46fac10f5d9939189f3e040023d7f67903dc093574d00405421d8bfa051558c2",
                      "raw_sha256": "dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf",
                      "source_id": "d97b56331f41a",
                      "start": 2377,
                      "text_sha256": "dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"
                    },
                    "text": "Should you wish to clarify any aspects of this circular, please contact the relevant case officers in charge.",
                    "unit_id": "d97b56331f41a.u13.2377"
                  },
                  {
                    "locator": "https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 2489:2517",
                    "normative": true,
                    "span": {
                      "end": 2517,
                      "id": "s.d97b56331f41a.u14.2489",
                      "page": 1,
                      "quote_sha256": "2262a17aa8ece28244aedc22e1f37fce7075bbeb018d04e4b3b36c1c9d0199ce",
                      "raw_sha256": "dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf",
                      "source_id": "d97b56331f41a",
                      "start": 2489,
                      "text_sha256": "dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"
                    },
                    "text": "Investment Products Division",
                    "unit_id": "d97b56331f41a.u14.2489"
                  },
                  {
                    "locator": "https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 2518:2551",
                    "normative": true,
                    "span": {
                      "end": 2551,
                      "id": "s.d97b56331f41a.u15.2518",
                      "page": 1,
                      "quote_sha256": "88e2bc94e9edc39f2ac1cdaaea86b44ab5ea59b31c446f69591f21bf460b005e",
                      "raw_sha256": "dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf",
                      "source_id": "d97b56331f41a",
                      "start": 2518,
                      "text_sha256": "dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"
                    },
                    "text": "Securities and Futures Commission",
                    "unit_id": "d97b56331f41a.u15.2518"
                  },
                  {
                    "locator": "https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 2556:2829",
                    "normative": true,
                    "span": {
                      "end": 2829,
                      "id": "s.d97b56331f41a.u17.2556",
                      "page": 1,
                      "quote_sha256": "8fbe2ff0c63ac687d1c454dff852bc02614d55243330fc29e2224ed902a018cb",
                      "raw_sha256": "dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf",
                      "source_id": "d97b56331f41a",
                      "start": 2556,
                      "text_sha256": "dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"
                    },
                    "text": "1\u00a0For this circular, UCITS funds means (i) Undertakings for Collective Investment in Transferable Securities (UCITS) domiciled in France, Luxembourg, Ireland and the Netherlands, and (ii) collective investment schemes domiciled in the United Kingdom authorised as UK UCITS.",
                    "unit_id": "d97b56331f41a.u17.2556"
                  },
                  {
                    "locator": "https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 2831:2912",
                    "normative": true,
                    "span": {
                      "end": 2912,
                      "id": "s.d97b56331f41a.u18.2831",
                      "page": 1,
                      "quote_sha256": "1165f873c1ac724cdaae7845afde205f9199c72b43e8a65fedfd87e50a170021",
                      "raw_sha256": "dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf",
                      "source_id": "d97b56331f41a",
                      "start": 2831,
                      "text_sha256": "dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"
                    },
                    "text": "2\u00a0Please refer to https://www.sfc.hk/en/faqs/Publicly-offered-investment-products",
                    "unit_id": "d97b56331f41a.u18.2831"
                  },
                  {
                    "locator": "https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=25EC66 chars 2914:3009",
                    "normative": true,
                    "span": {
                      "end": 3009,
                      "id": "s.d97b56331f41a.u19.2914",
                      "page": 1,
                      "quote_sha256": "cd78ab60682647403216aaed9b6a4c899403a66752ce9d5310c294e2feb727ec",
                      "raw_sha256": "dbce3ab4d172a64d8e2f8f5ba1664db8886862ecf87205e9e72ea07fdafb1dcf",
                      "source_id": "d97b56331f41a",
                      "start": 2914,
                      "text_sha256": "dc786160064c15ca7200596f384b098024230856c8ec86e60248f8c2241da68d"
                    },
                    "text": "3\u00a0Please refer to https://www.sfc.hk/en/Forms/products/Investment-products-Forms-and-checklists",
                    "unit_id": "d97b56331f41a.u19.2914"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "candidates": {
                "node.ea4d19630f8cab09065b1909": {
                  "assumptions": [
                    "This models only eligibility for the circular's stated approval relief, subject to unavailable operational authorities.",
                    "The specific Effective Date governs the introductory immediate-effect language.",
                    "An application received before the Effective Date and unapproved at that date preserves the existing process and blocks use of this relief for the selected application.",
                    "Novelty, complexity and possible local policy implications independently defeat item (ii) relief.",
                    "The purpose statement does not add a separate home-supervision test to item (ii).",
                    "The identified change is assessed as a whole; no severability or withdrawal rule is inferred."
                  ],
                  "citations": [
                    {
                      "quote": "Removing the SFC\u2019s requirement on prior approval for material changes in investment objectives, policies and restrictions which comply with the fund\u2019s home jurisdiction requirements, except for changes that involve novel or complex product features and/or which may have local policy implications.",
                      "unit_id": "d97b56331f41a.u5.840"
                    },
                    {
                      "quote": "Existing applications received by the SFC before the Effective Date for which no approval or authorisation has been granted will be processed by the SFC in accordance with the existing approval or authorisation process.",
                      "unit_id": "d97b56331f41a.u10.1809"
                    },
                    {
                      "quote": "The streamlined measures set out in the relevant FAQs will take effect on 28 November 2025 (Effective Date).",
                      "unit_id": "d97b56331f41a.u9.1696"
                    },
                    {
                      "quote": "For this circular, UCITS funds means (i) Undertakings for Collective Investment in Transferable Securities (UCITS) domiciled in France, Luxembourg, Ireland and the Netherlands, and (ii) collective investment schemes domiciled in the United Kingdom authorised as UK UCITS.",
                      "unit_id": "d97b56331f41a.u17.2556"
                    },
                    {
                      "quote": "The key streamlined measures cover the following post-authorisation matters:",
                      "unit_id": "d97b56331f41a.u3.575"
                    }
                  ],
                  "distinction": "Retains the parent's practical attachment of the transition to relief eligibility. Otherwise identical qualifying changes can receive different results because one has a preserved application. The strongest uncertainty is that the transition expressly addresses processing, while the additional substantive exclusion is an inference.",
                  "family": "exceptions",
                  "formalization": {
                    "facts": [
                      {
                        "meaning": "The fund is either a UCITS domiciled in France, Luxembourg, Ireland or the Netherlands, or a UK-domiciled collective investment scheme authorised as UK UCITS.",
                        "name": "covered_ucits",
                        "requires_judgment": true,
                        "source_unit_ids": [
                          "d97b56331f41a.u17.2556"
                        ],
                        "type": "bool",
                        "unit": "truth value"
                      },
